<title>HUNGARY: All three Hungary BUBOR rates flat.</title>
<headline>All three Hungary BUBOR rates flat.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) remained unchanged on Wednesday, the National Bank of Hungary said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was set at 20.80 percent, the three-month rate at 20.90 percent, while the six-month rate was fixed at 21.00 percent, all three unchanged from Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
